{"id":"82278068a67b12306615dbae2fad48a575a9cc95","axis":"silent","repo":"salvo-rs/salvo","sha":"82278068a67b12306615dbae2fad48a575a9cc95","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,18 @@ The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/)."," "," ### Fixed"," ","+- Exclude pending cookie jar changes and partial responses from response caching,","+  and bypass cached representations for range requests.","+- Forward parameter names through optional extractors and reject missing required","+  header, query and cookie values before constructing their wrappers.","+- Honor ETag precedence, lists and wildcards in conditional responses, while","+  preserving write responses and non-200 statuses.","+- Preserve response trailers during compression and offload compression flushing","+  and finalization together with expensive writes.","+- Validate tus creation requests before allocating storage, remove uploads after","+  creation-time stream failures, and pass final storage metadata to completion hooks.","+- Merge multipart form and file schemas instead of overwriting earlier endpoint","+  parameters, preserving required fields and form constraints."," - Generate `Allow` for automatic 405 responses from complete built-in route matches,","   without replaying custom callbacks or overriding middleware response policies.","   When opaque filters prevent safely inferring any supported method, routing defaults"],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/cache/Cargo.toml","lines":["@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@ tokio = { workspace = true, features = [\"sync\"] }"," tracing = { workspace = true }"," "," [dev-dependencies]","-salvo_core = { workspace = true, features = [\"test\"] }","+salvo_core = { workspace = true, features = [\"test\", \"cookie\"] }"," tokio = { workspace = true, features = [\"macros\", \"rt-multi-thread\", \"time\"] }"," time = { workspace = true }"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path